    "policy": {
     "tiers": "Source tiers, best first: vendor-layout (the subject part's OWN datasheet layout section / eval board / reference layout) > vendor-appnote (same vendor, the topology) > cross-vendor (another vendor's note on the same topology/interface) > forum (corroboration only - NEVER a record's sole source; the close step refuses it). Declare the tier per fetch (--tier); vendor community subdomains are forced to forum. Prefer the highest tier that actually covers the operating point; two independent tiers beat one when they disagree - record the disagreement in prose.",
